            "review_title": "Review at Quán Bò Né Quốc Minh",
            "review_text": "ヤマハ\n京都454 contributions\n0\nYou're free to eat.\nAug 2024 • Solo\nBeef steak with fried eggs served hot with baguette on a single-person iron plate.\nBreakfast menu in Da Nang and Hoi An. Visit at 6 a.m. Shops close at noon.\nBasic seasoning is done according to each person's preference and with seasonings placed on the table.\nA lot of people seem to like chilli sauce, but I have a choice of Vietnamese soy sauce (Nyok Thu).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten October 17, 2024",
